wgf-autopilot 1
# A smoke run: the robot's file loaded, its idle clip playing, then N, Space, and Space again.
at 1 wait model.loaded == 1
at 2 expect model.clips == 14
at 2 expect model.clip == 2
at 60 key tap n
at 62 expect model.clip == 3
at 90 key tap space
at 92 expect model.paused == 1
at 120 key tap space
at 122 expect model.paused == 0
at 180 end
